      <solution>
        <list type="ordered">
          <item>$$\mathbb{R}$$</item>
          <item>$$y$$ -int $$0$$ ; $$x$$ -int $$n\pi$$ ( $$n$$ an integer)</item>
          <item>About $$(0,0)$$ , period $$2\pi$$</item>
          <item>None E–G answers for $$0 \leqslant x \leqslant \pi$$ :</item>
          <item>Inc on $$\left( {0,\pi/2} \right)$$ ; dec on $$\left( {\pi/2,\pi} \right)$$</item>
          <item>Loc max $$f\left( {\pi/2} \right) = 1$$</item>
          <item>Let $$\alpha = \sin^{- 1}\sqrt{2/3}$$ ; CU on $$\left( {0,\alpha} \right)$$ , $$\left( {\pi - \alpha,\pi} \right)$$ ; CD on $$\left( {\alpha,\pi - \alpha} \right)$$ ; IPs at $$x = 0$$ , $$\pi$$ , $$\alpha$$ , $$\pi - \alpha$$</item>
        </list>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
