      <solution>
        <list type="ordered">
          <item>$$\left\lbrack {- 2\pi,2\pi} \right\rbrack$$</item>
          <item>$$y$$ -int $$\sqrt{3}$$ ; $$x$$ -int $$- 4\pi/3$$ , $$- \pi/3$$ , $$2\pi/3$$ , $$5\pi/3$$</item>
          <item>Period $$2\pi$$</item>
          <item>None</item>
          <item>Inc on $$\left( {- 2\pi, - 11\pi/6} \right)$$ , $$\left( {- 5\pi/6,\pi/6} \right)$$ , $$\left( {7\pi/6,2\pi} \right)$$ ; dec on $$\left( {- 11\pi/6, - 5\pi/6} \right)$$ , $$\left( {\pi/6,7\pi/6} \right)$$</item>
          <item>Loc max $$f( - 11\pi/6) = f(\pi/6) = 2$$ ; loc min $$f\left( {- 5\pi/6} \right) = f\left( {7\pi/6} \right) = - 2$$</item>
          <item>CU on $$\left( {- 4\pi/3, - \pi/3} \right)$$ , $$\left( {2\pi/3,5\pi/3} \right)$$ ; CD on $$\left( {- 2\pi, - 4\pi/3} \right)$$ , $$\left( {- \pi/3,2\pi/3} \right)$$ , $$\left( {5\pi/3,2\pi} \right)$$ ; IPs $$\left( {- 4\pi/3,0} \right)$$ , $$\left( {- \pi/3,0} \right)$$ , $$\left( {2\pi/3,0} \right)$$ , $$\left( {5\pi/3,0} \right)$$</item>
          <item>See graph below.</item>
        </list>
